The '''Terrabe sector''' was one of the [[freestanding subsectors]] of the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] region of [[the galaxy]].<ref name="RO World Locations" /> It contained the [[Jedha system]] and [[Endovar system]]<ref name="Appendix" /> and was home to the [[Terrabe Sector Service Academy]].<ref name="Rebel Dossier" />

